# Keep the build context small — a stray sub-project or nested node_modules
# turns a 30MB context into hundreds of MB and slows every build.
# A bare `node_modules` matches only the ROOT; the ** form is required.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/dist

.git
.claude
.vercel
docs
coverage

# Test tooling is excluded from the production image for two reasons: it is not
# needed at runtime, and playwright.config.ts imports the shared kit at
# ../ops/qa/ which is OUTSIDE the build context — leaving it in makes the
# production type-check fail with "Cannot find module '../ops/qa/...'".
tests
playwright.config.*
playwright-report
test-results
*.tsbuildinfo

.env*
!.env.example
npm-debug.log*
*.md
